  "label": "User projected onto the textual punchline",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'the rope' in the bottom panel, as this is the punchline of the dark joke. The user is expected to understand the morbid pun and identify with the joke's structure, even though no explicit deictic pronoun is used. The projection is implicit through the meme's narrative structure, where the user is invited to complete the joke by interpreting the visual pun.",
